{"capturado_en": "2026-11-12T01:27:44+00:00", "respuesta": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pick a Legend", "steam_appid": 2844300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a team of heroes and pets in a fantasy bullet heaven. Level up companions, evolve devastating attacks, and battle monster hordes and bosses. Play solo or with up to four players in local cooperative play.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build your fighting team</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 16 heroes and collect 8 companions. Your pets fight alongside you, level up, and gain attacks of their own. Combine their abilities with upgrades and defensive boosts to shape your team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive together</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to four players on a shared screen. Steam Remote Play Together lets you stream your local cooperative session to friends over the internet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Transform your build</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strengthen your attacks and unlock powerful evolutions. Experiment with hero abilities, companion attacks, and defensive boosts to find combinations that can defeat the bosses.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More to discover</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore 6 levels and a boss dungeon across 4 game modes. Experiment with 37 attacks, 5 evolutions, 16 hero abilities, 19 attributes, 22 upgrades with over 60 levels, and 20 defensive boosts. Face 47 bosses, including 17 with distinctive moves and attack patterns, and unlock 77 Steam achievements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2844300/extras/d27619ddc93c1018b0d2a4d7b4e7313c.poster.avif?t=1791406326\" aria-label=\"A game about love. (The warm, fuzzy kind. Also the &quot;whoops, I got smacked&quot; kind.)\" width=550